		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Bullet Debug Visualization]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=42429#p42429"><![CDATA[
Hi,<br>I have created a basic debug viewer for Bullet while working on my game engine.<br>It uses three.js to render debug lines, and communicates to the application (i.e. server) via web socket.<br><br>Link: <a href="https://github.com/malhotraprateek/bullet-visualization" class="postlink">https://github.com/malhotraprateek/bullet-visualization</a><br><br>Included in the repo is some reference code for creating the server (C++) using the net11 library (details on github).<br>For now, it can only draw debug lines (no contact points or text).<br><br>The project is MIT licensed and contributions are very welcome <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":)" title="Smile"><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=12783">mprk</a> — Mon Oct 21, 2019 7:34 am</p><hr />
